abstractNote:
Consists of the following nine individual artists' books:

Foldout unit on historical sites of Brooklyn, by Janet Antich;

Circular subway guide to Brooklyn, by George Chang; 

Brooklyn Palimpsest: a brief & incomplete historical geography of Brooklyn, by Matt Knutzen; 

Snapshots of Brooklyn from a bike, by George Larkins; 

Earth samplings: Coney Island, Navy Yard, Greenpoint Cemetery all in Brooklyn, by Kate Mole;

Wear:t, we:art, by Minami Moriya;

Ethnic food samplings of Brooklyn, by Pete Riesett; 

Statistics of the borough of Brooklyn, by Andrea Simkowski; 

Original photographs of Brooklyn settings, by Amy Upton.
